OL,3,GNEWSAMan attacked shopper who stopped
OL,4,Aaisle bike boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who attacked a shopper for
OL,7,Fstopping a group of boys riding bikes
OL,8,Faround a supermarket has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor a year and a half.
OL,11,FStuart Scott, 45, punched the victim
OL,12,Fmore than 20 times after being falsely
OL,13,Ftold the man had assaulted the youths
OL,14,Fwho were terrorising shoppers in
OL,15,FSainsbury's in Heaton, Newcastle Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard.
OL,18,FThe victim, who was left with a broken
OL,19,Frib and fractures to spinal vertebrae,
OL,20,Fsaid he would still intervene in the
OL,21,Ffuture to stop anti-social behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
